  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Research Institute Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Institute Initiatives shall contribute to economic growth and welfare in ODA-countries. This will be achieved with more systematic linking and communication of research-based knowledge on poverty-related topics by the research institutes Norwegian Institute of International Affairs (NUPI), Peace Research Institute Oslo (PRIO), Chr. Michelsen institute (CMI) and Fridtjof Nansen Institute (FNI), with the aim of being used by decision makers, special target groups and the public.</narrative>
  </description>
